# {{NAME}} Agent Instructions

This workspace manages {{DOMAIN}} items.

## Default Item Setup Flow

When asked to create, add, or set up a new item:

1. Ask only for missing blocking information.
2. Run `manager-setup/scripts/bootstrap-item.sh <item-name>` to register the item.
3. Continue implementation until done.
4. Run `manager-setup/scripts/update-inventory.sh` before finishing.
5. Report the item path and what was created.

## Defaults

- Owner: {{OWNER}}
- Items folder: `manager-setup/items/`
- Inventory folder: `manager-setup/inventory/`

## Blocking Questions

Ask before continuing when missing:

- Item name
- Any configuration that cannot be safely defaulted

## Inventory Requirement

The root `README.md` inventory is the source of truth. Always update it after any item change.
